    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Overcommitment to the Bit: How Catra Became an Ordained Minister</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;You know how sometimes you hear about some genuinely bizarre and weird thing someone does on the side, but the steps there seemed pretty logical?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to how Catra accidentally became a legally ordained minister thanks to anxiety, spite, and over committing to the bit!&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
