          <rdf:li>Basically finished honestly</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra's had therapy and is doing her best</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>sometimes being a best friend means being a weirdo</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>ordained minister Catra</rdf:li>
